{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321609001:0":{"text":"德米，你说的两个地方都不是你家。","source_cn":"德米，你说的两个地方都不是你家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9A7A03B00334691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321609002:1":{"text":"不是……我家……","source_cn":"不是……我家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3862D04C4ACE18BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321609003:0":{"text":"是啊。比起你家，这里更像是你和你妹妹偷偷跑出来冒险的地方。毕竟你也说了好几次，这附近很危险，经常有活死人出没。","source_cn":"是啊。比起你家，这里更像是你和你妹妹偷偷跑出来冒险的地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECCDA5E0967AFB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321609004:0":{"text":"一般来说，民居应该都是雪松镇附近。你对雪松镇有没有印象？","source_cn":"一般来说，民居应该都是雪松镇附近。你对雪松镇有没有印象？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0E65C7892FCA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321609005:1":{"text":"雪松镇……\n我……记得名字，记得……广场上，很多人……","source_cn":"雪松镇……\\n我……记得名字，记得……广场上，很多人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36993A8C515067A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c